---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Health Calculators"
  description="How Health Calculators handles data. Our calculators run in your browser; this policy covers cookies, analytics, and advertising."
>
  <article class="content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      This policy explains what information Health Calculators collects and how
      it is used. In short: the calculators run in your browser, and we keep
      data collection to a minimum.
    </p>

    <h2>Calculator inputs stay on your device</h2>
    <p>
      Every calculation on this site is performed locally in your web browser.
      The numbers you enter — such as height, weight, or age — are not sent to
      us or stored on any server. When you close or refresh the page, those
      inputs are gone.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
    <p>
      We use a single small piece of local storage to remember whether you have
      accepted or declined our cookie notice, so we do not show it on every
      visit. This preference never leaves your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics to understand which calculators are popular and
      how the site performs. Analytics storage is denied by default. If you
      accept non-essential cookies, Google Analytics may use cookies or similar
      identifiers; if you decline, Analytics storage remains denied.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site may display Google AdSense advertising where appropriate.
      Google and its advertising partners may place and read cookies in your
      browser and may use web beacons, IP addresses, or similar identifiers.
      Information may be collected, shared, or used as a result of ad serving
      to deliver, limit, measure, and report advertisements.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can manage cookies through your browser settings and any consent or
      privacy controls displayed on the site. Learn more through Google&apos;s
      <a
        href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer">How Google uses information from partner sites</a
      > and <a
        href="https://adssettings.google.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer">advertising controls</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      Our pages may link to external websites. We are not responsible for the
      content or privacy practices of those sites, and we encourage you to read
      their own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is intended for a general adult audience and is not directed at
      children. The calculators are designed for adults and should not be relied
      on for children or teenagers.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on
      this page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy? Reach us through our
      <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
